<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="Hu0UC3F5gf0-A2EcCrga">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1417" dy="1952" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="light-dark(#ffffff, #121212)" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="nBDEJDvTCTi-FnzneaTW-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Functional Requirements :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. User should be able to login and authorised to hospitals system.&lt;div&gt;2. User should be able to book an appointment based on doctors avaialiability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. User should be able to see upcomimng appointments&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. User should be able to see the prescription from the last appointments&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Non - Functional Requirements:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Scale : Millions of User making millions of appointments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. CAP : A &amp;gt;&amp;gt; C in case of showing user the upcoming appointments and seeing reservations. But C &amp;gt;&amp;gt; A in case of making an appointment or doing transactions through app to buy medicines.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Latecny : As Availability is what matters us the most so we can expect the latency of 8-9 ms. But in case of transactions and reservations it should be 3-4 ms.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Core Entities :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. User&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Doctor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Appointment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Designing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. See the doctors appointments : GET : /api/v1/doctors/{doctor_id}/appointments&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. See the available doctors : GET : /api/v1/department/{department_id}/doctors/{doctor_status ? = available}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Reserve an appointment : POST :&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;/api/v1/doctors/{doctor_id}/appointments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4. Login and Auth : POST : /api/v1/auth/login&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5. Register a user : POST : /api/v1/auth/register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;6. Prescription : GET :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;/api/v1/doctors/{doctor_id}/appointments/{appointment_id}/prescriptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Low level design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="800" x="20" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
